@title Open House Guide for Families
@subtitle Cedarwood Elementary
@author Dr. Leonie Osei, Principal

Welcome! We cannot wait to meet you and show you our school.

## When and where

kpi Thursday 2026-11-12 | 17:30 to 19:30 | Main building, 410 Elm Street

## Schedule

step Welcome from the principal | 17:30 | Gym
step Classroom tours | 17:50 | Groups of 8 families, about 30 minutes each
step Kindergarten information session | 18:30 | Library
step After-school program table | 18:45 | Cafeteria
step Closing words | 19:15

## What to bring

Planning to register for 2027-28 kindergarten? Bring:

- A birth certificate
- Proof of address
- Immunization records

Registration opens on 2027-01-12.

## Getting here

- Free parking in the Elm Street lot, 60 spaces.
- A free shuttle runs every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot.
- Childcare for siblings is offered in the music room.

## Questions

Call 555-0166 or write to office@cedarwood.example.
